DESCRIPTION:We're turning up the suspense! Celebrating a milestone year\, 
 as MOTIVE 2026 unveils its most expansive and riveting programme to date\,
  featuring more than 55 events\, author talks\, masterclasses and immersiv
 e workshops designed to captivate crime and mystery lovers of all kinds. F
 eaturing Shari Lapena\, Clare Mackintosh\, Nita Prose\, Nicholas Shakespea
 re\, Don Gillmor and Doug Johnstone.
LOCATION:Victoria University at the University of Toronto\, 91 Charles St 
 W\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://festivalofauthors.ca/motive-2026-box-office/
