DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T130000
UID:868ff68e32f1d01e78d16fce3795df3f@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a neighbourhood-wide celebration of soccer's bigge
 st event in Toronto! Featuring live freestyle performances by world-renown
 ed athletes\, interactive fan experiences including Juggle Zone\, Knee Gra
 b\, Urban Run and a curated Neighbourhood Soccer Trail of things to do. Wi
 th high-energy programming and immersive activations\, we're excited to sh
 owcase Bloor-Yorkville signature blend of culture\, cuisine\, retail\, and
  wellness.
