DESCRIPTION:Watch as we transform Nathan Phillips Square into a high-energ
 y\, global playground and celebrate Toronto's "World in a City" identity. 
 Tap into your latin flare with open-air dance floor with top Latin DJs\, s
 alsa\, bachata and dance workshops and show-stopping Latin dance performan
 ces\, thunderous drumming ensembles and live salsa big bands and Latin orc
 hestras. Be dazzled by Chinese lion and fan dances and K-Pop and Bollywood
  showcases. Enjoy acrobatics\, samba\, mariachi and feast on our interatio
 nal market\, cuisine\, food truck alley and shopping. Watch live matches o
 f soccer's biggest event! Perfect for the whole family\, this isn't just a
  festival\, it's a full-on cultural explosion in the heart of the city.
LOCATION:Nathan Phillips Square\, 100 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON
